<title>USA: Cardiometrics mails proxy to shareholders.</title>
<headline>Cardiometrics mails proxy to shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cardiometrics Inc said it mailed proxy statements to its stockholders for a  July 23 special meeting to vote on a merger agreement with a wholly-owned unit of EndoSonics Corp.</p>
<p>The special meeting will be held at Cardiometrics' headquarters in  Mountain View, California.</p>
